6365    MIRER.P                 TRIED TO FIND THE MDB FOR AN ABORT
                                REQUEST, BUT THE MDB DID NOT EXIST.

                                  VALUE #2 = MIRROR UDB

6366    MIRER.P                 TRIED TO MAP IN A USER TCB, BUT COULDN'T

                                  VALUE #2 = USER TCB ADDRESS

6367    DRLSE.P                 LDU DIB NOT INITIALIZED ON RELEASE

                                  VALUE #3 = DIB BH ADDRESS

