                                THE RTPTB.  SINCE IT NEVER LEAVES
                                THE QUEUE, THIS INDICATES THAT THE
                                ELQUE HAS BEEN TRASHED.

14666           TRTN            A CONTROL BLOCK WAS ABOUT TO RETURN
                                AND IT WAS FOUND TO BE HOLDING A LOCK.

                                VALUE #1 = SHARED CNT / EXCLUSIVE CNT
                                VALUE #3 = CB ADDRESS

